OL,3,GNEWSACity's Remembrance Service moved
OL,4,Ato Armistice Day
OL,5,
OL,6,FLincoln's annual Remembrance Service
OL,7,Fwill be held on Armistice Day from now
OL,8,Fon instead of Remembrance Sunday.
OL,10,FThis year's service, organised by City
OL,11,Fof Lincoln Council in conjunction with
OL,12,Fthe Royal British Legion, will begin on
OL,13,F11 November at 10:15 GMT at the city's
OL,14,Fwar memorial, followed by a civic
OL,15,Fprocession.
OL,17,FA two-minute silence will be observed
OL,18,Fat 11:00 to mark the time the agreement
OL,19,Fto end the fighting in World War One
OL,20,Fcame about on 11 November 1918.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
