OL,3,GNEWSACity's Remembrance Service moved
OL,4,Ato Armistice Day
OL,5,
OL,6,FKate Fenn, the council's civic and
OL,7,Finternational partnerships manager,
OL,8,Fsaid: "We welcome residents, visitors,
OL,9,Fbusinesses and organisations to join us
OL,10,Fin paying tribute to all those who have
OL,11,Fserved, and continue to serve, in the
OL,12,Farmed forces."
